  "description": "<p>The Fedora repository homepage at <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fedora/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fedora/</a> has the following content:</p>\n\n\n<p>Apache-AXIS<br/>\nHello! Welcome to Apache-Axis.</p>\n\n<p>What do you want to do today?</p>\n\n<p>Administer Axis <a href=\"#1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">link #1</a><br/>\nVisit the Axis Servlet <a href=\"#2\" rel=\"noreferrer\">link #2</a></p>\n\n\n<p>Link #1 above links to <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fedora/servlet/AdminServlet\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fedora/servlet/AdminServlet</a>. But this link is broken: it returns a 404 error page (rather, it should &#8211; see also bug \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-407\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-407\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"404 &quot;Not found&quot; page never shown -- generates an error\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-407\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n). </p>\n\n<p>Either this link should be made to work, or it should be removed entirely. Thanks!</p>",
